refactor: update architecture to remove SQS ingestion queue

- Remove SQS queue and S3 event notification from the architecture, as uploads to S3 will no longer automatically push messages to an SQS queue.
- Consolidate S3, API Gateway, and Pre-signed URL Lambda infrastructure into a single `upload-pipeline.yaml` template.
- Rename and retain component templates (`audio-s3.yaml`, `api-lambda.yaml`) for reference.
